              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy Robbins"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family loved this. Made a big bowl for a family event and it was gone faster than anything else. I used the apples I had on hand, and walla walla sweet onions. I did add bacon, but I used the candied bacon I made the day before. A month later I am still getting emails asking for this recipe.",
